#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk6
#: index.docbook:34
#, no-c-format
msgid "&minuet; is KDE's music education app for ear training, rhythm practice, and guided singing. It groups exercises by topic, lets you switch between listening and performance-based practice, and exposes sound and microphone settings for different instruments and rooms."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#. +> stable6
#: index.docbook:34
#, no-c-format
msgid "&minuet; is an application for music education. It features a set of ear training exercises regarding intervals, chords, and scales."
